  "notes": "AI-planned (Claude). v5 keeps the v4 chords, sections and per-chord keys unchanged. Changes: (1) the soprano melody in swirl, bitone and tritone is now M_syl, a 2-bar syllabic patter (repeated notes, short staccato notes, accented pickups) so the line has consonants; M_sigh remains only in mist and dissolve as the long-vowel line. (2) M_hold adds a slow baritone voice of whole notes stepping down, one per bar. M_echo and M_call stay as the slower middle voices. The Bb drone is NOT in this JSON; hold a Bb2 in Logic. Bass in the stand-in MIDI is the McCartney-style line, not Forma output. Each chord section restarts its rhythm cells in Forma; the stand-in MIDI keeps them running.",
